  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about migration",
     "texto": [
      "**Innvandring** is migration to a country; **innvandrer** is a person who has immigrated. **Flyktning** is a person who has had to flee their country."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Taking part in society",
     "texto": [
      "**Integrering** is taking part in society while keeping one's dignity and rights. **Inkludering** means people have access and feel welcome."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
